# Đề bài

Tính giá trị các biểu thức sau:
- a) $A = \sin^2 3^{\circ}  + \sin^2 15^{\circ}  + \sin^2 75^{\circ}  + \sin^2 87^{\circ} $
- b) $B = \cos 0^{\circ}  + \cos 20^{\circ}  + \cos 40^{\circ}  + \cdots + \cos 160^{\circ}  + \cos 180^{\circ} $
- c) $C = \tan 5^{\circ}  \cdot \tan 10^{\circ}  \cdot \tan 15^{\circ}  \cdots \tan 80^{\circ}  \cdot \tan 85^{\circ} $

# Lời giải

- a) 
$$
A = \left(\sin^2 3^{\circ}  + \sin^2 87^{\circ} \right) + \left(\sin^2 15^{\circ}  + \sin^2 75^{\circ} \right)
= \left(\sin^2 3^{\circ}  + \cos^2 3^{\circ} \right) + \left(\sin^2 15^{\circ}  + \cos^2 15^{\circ} \right) = 1 + 1 = 2
$$
- b) 
$$
B = \left(\cos 0^{\circ}  + \cos 180^{\circ} \right) + \left(\cos 20^{\circ}  + \cos 160^{\circ} \right) + \cdots + \left(\cos 80^{\circ}  + \cos 100^{\circ} \right)
$$
$$
B = (\cos 0^{\circ}  - \cos 0^{\circ} ) + (\cos 20^{\circ}  - \cos 20^{\circ} ) + \cdots + (\cos 80^{\circ}  - \cos 80^{\circ} ) = 0
$$
- c) 
$$
C = \left(\tan 5^{\circ}  \cdot \tan 85^{\circ} \right)\left(\tan 15^{\circ}  \cdot \tan 75^{\circ} \right) \cdots \left(\tan 45^{\circ}  \cdot \tan 45^{\circ} \right)
$$
$$
= \left(\tan 5^{\circ}  \cdot \cot 5^{\circ} \right)\left(\tan 15^{\circ}  \cdot \cot 15^{\circ} \right)\cdots\left(\tan 45^{\circ}  \cdot \cot 45^{\circ} \right) = 1
$$

