Ta có
$$\cos^2\alpha=1-\sin^2\alpha=1-\left(\dfrac{2}{\sqrt{5}}\right)^2=\dfrac{1}{5}.$$

Do $\alpha$ là góc tù nên $\cos\alpha=-\dfrac{1}{\sqrt{5}}$. Khi đó,
$$A=3\cos \alpha+4\sin\alpha=-3\dfrac{1}{\sqrt{5}}+4\cdot\dfrac{2}{\sqrt{5}}=\sqrt{5}.$$

