        \foreach \x/\g in {A/90,B/-120,C/-60} 
        \fill[black] (\x) circle (1pt)+(\g:3mm) node {$\x$};
    \end{tikzpicture}
\end{center}

# Lời giải

Ta có $\widehat{A} = 180^\circ - (\widehat{B}+\widehat{C}) = 180^\circ - (30^{\circ}+45^{\circ}) = 105^{\circ}$.
Áp dụng định lí sin ta có:
$$
\dfrac{AB}{\sin C} = \dfrac{BC}{\sin A} \Rightarrow AB = \dfrac{BC\sin C}{\sin A} = \dfrac{40 \cdot \sin 45^{\circ}}{\sin 105^{\circ}} \approx 29,3 \mathrm{~(cm)}.
$$
$$
\dfrac{AC}{\sin B} = \dfrac{BC}{\sin A} \Rightarrow AC = \dfrac{BC\sin B}{\sin A} = \dfrac{40 \cdot \sin 30^{\circ}}{\sin 105^{\circ}} \approx 20,7 \mathrm{~(cm)}.
$$

