\dfrac{BC}{\sin 45^{\circ}} = \dfrac{AB}{\sin 56{,}31^{\circ}} = \dfrac{4 \sqrt{26}}{\sin 56{,}31^{\circ}} \Rightarrow BC \approx 17{,}33.
